302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 102 0 R
/T (The results showed that the three models performed differently on the traffic accident severity problem. The Random Forest model generally gave the best result, with an accuracy of 72.84% and a weighted F1 score of 71.45%. Meanwhile, the KNN model had a lower accuracy of 67.11% but achieved the highest overall F1 score of 46.37%. This means that KNN performed better when looking at the four severity categories more evenly, while Random Forest performed better overall.)
/E (The results showed that the three models performed differently on the traffic accident severity problem. The Random Forest model generally gave the best result, with an accuracy of 72.84% and a weighted F1 score of 71.45%. Meanwhile, the KNN model had a lower accuracy of 67.11% but achieved the highest overall F1 score of 46.37%. This means that KNN performed better when looking at the four severity categories more evenly, while Random Forest performed better overall.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
