/T (There were some limitations in this project. We used 1,000,000 records instead of the full dataset due to available computing resources. We also didn't do thorough hyperparameter tuning or use specific techniques to balance severity classes. Another limitation is that the dataset is based on traffic incidents in the United States, so the results might not directly apply to other countries.)
/E (There were some limitations in this project. We used 1,000,000 records instead of the full dataset due to available computing resources. We also didn't do thorough hyperparameter tuning or use specific techniques to balance severity classes. Another limitation is that the dataset is based on traffic incidents in the United States, so the results might not directly apply to other countries.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
