/E (Overall, the project showed that GPU-supported tools can be useful when working with a large traffic accident dataset. The random forest model was the best in terms of overall accuracy and weighted F1 scores, while the KNN model performed better in overall F1 and used the GPU much more. In the future, improving predictions for the less common categories will be an important step, especially for severity category 4, since correctly identifying severe accidents can be more important than just achieving high overall accuracy.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
