/Title (GPU results also varied between the models. KNN had the highest GPU usage, averaging 97.96%, while logistic regression and random forest showed around 0% average usage during the measured inference period. KNN also took much longer during inference, showing that higher GPU usage doesn't necessarily mean the model is better or faster.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 30 0 R
/Prev 598 0 R
/Next 421 0 R
>>
