<<
/Title (Of course, there are several challenges faced in the project related to how to handle big data and deal with different types of data like time and date, as well as measuring the performance of the GPU.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 596 0 R
/Next 818 0 R
>>
endobj
705 0 obj
<<
/Title (Challenge 4: Differences in GPU Usage Between Models During the work with the three models, they differed in how they used the GPU during inference. The Random Forest and Logistic Regression models showed almost no GPU usage, around 0%. Meanwhile, the KNN model used the GPU at 97.96%. All of them used the GPU, but in different ways.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 596 0 R
/Prev 819 0 R
>>
